&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have shaped architecture and platform strategy at an enterprise scale, navigating the trade-offs of hybrid and cloud-agnostic infrastructures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a polyglot mindset, matching the right technology to the challenge rather than defaulting to a single stack (comfortable exploring React, Python, or Go when needed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity—you&#39;re energized by learning new technologies and approaches to solve edge routing and platform enablement challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
