&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Oversee the translation of needs into detailed epics and initiatives, ensuring alignment with overall product strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
