&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Helping clients&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;and explore where AI and automation could add value,&amp;nbsp;shaping&amp;nbsp;practical use cases and supporting early adoption&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
