&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a scripting language (we use Python and JavaScript)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building frontend applications (we use TypeScript, React, and GraphQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with various database technologies and query languages (we use Neo4j, Kafka, MySQL, Snowflake, OpenSearch, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with low-latency techniques to help improve page load time and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with microservices, APIs, and related standards such as REST, HTTP, and OAuth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with AWS Cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using log analysis to investigate bugs and performance issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit and integration tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile team&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ideal Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can mobilize teams around a vision and help lead execution of that vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data modeling and schema design of real world use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has prior experience with machine learning builds and release at commercial scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defines best practices and standards within the team and helps build tooling to make those easy to follow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing tables, schemas and data structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to determine sensible KPIs and optimize against them&lt;/li&gt;
